# Pipeline TODO discipline

## Source of truth

Read and update [`docs/TODO_PIPELINE.md`](docs/TODO_PIPELINE.md) for Stage 0
scientific milestones. Session TodoWrite items must mirror that file when the
task is pipeline work.

## At session start (and before new pipeline work)

1. Open `docs/TODO_PIPELINE.md`.
2. Identify the first milestone that is `in_progress` or the first `pending`
   after the last `done`.
3. Work that milestone; do not jump to optional / deferred layers early.

## When marking complete

Only set status to `done` when the milestone's **Done when** acceptance criteria
are truly met (reports, artifacts, tests, or round-trip checks exist). Scaffolding,
CLI stubs, download scripts, or model class definitions alone are not enough.

Update `docs/TODO_PIPELINE.md` in the same change set that finishes the milestone.
Keep Cursor session todos in sync (complete / cancel / start next).

## Ordering (do not reorder without an ADR)

1. Inspect one small real source
2. Canonical annotation graph (simple regions)
3. Static locus features (CpGPT default)
4. One pilot canonical matrix
5. Flat DeepRVAT-style baseline
5b. Phenotype registry + multi-pack eval
5b′. Hub/Atlas metadata structure (required before 5c)
5c. Multitask shared encoder
5d. Max-N flat age/tissue/sex
6. Hierarchical region model
7A. Harmonized data release + phenotype census (**current gate**)
7B. Complete nine-pack canonical matrices
7C. Supervised architecture corrections (multi-path scores, splits, heads)
7D. Fold-fitted Level-1 normalization
7E. Development CV (architecture selection)
7. Final study-grouped OOF cross-fitting (blocked until 7A–7E)
8. Optional layers only after 1–7

Ordering after Milestone 6 is locked by
[`docs/adr/0007-crossfit-prerequisites.md`](docs/adr/0007-crossfit-prerequisites.md).
Programme brief:
[`docs/plans/post-v0-scientific-programme.md`](docs/plans/post-v0-scientific-programme.md).

